CodeSystem: CancerCCCtCategorySnomedCS
Id: cancer-ccc-t-category-snomed-cs
Title: "Cancer CCC T Category SNOMED CT Supplement"
Description: "SNOMED CT supplement containing Uzbek and Russian designations for cancer CCC T category concepts used in the Uzbekistan healthcare system."

